ulty":1,"explanation":"\u201cRelincho\u201d \u00e9 uma palavra onomatopaica, que imita o som do chamado de um cavalo.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-55c9-76a3-8152-002f73aff7f5","description":"Relincho","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-55c9-777d-8fed-176b13966722","description":"Muu","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-55c9-7a75-a6b3-7e14985df564","description":"B\u00ea\u00ea","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-55c9-70d3-a42c-6e554ae8056d","description":"Oink","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-55c9-7821-b96c-94c4a0aaeea1","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a21348-94aa-7eae-ba09-829334cba03f","question":"Em um veleiro, qual lado \u00e9 chamado de \u201cbabor\u201d?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A esquerda \u00e9 o lado de babor; os navios o sinalizam com uma luz de navega\u00e7\u00e3o vermelha, enquanto o lado de estibordo \u00e9 sinalizado com verde.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-55c9-7453-a872-227423a69137","description":"Esquerda","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-55c9-7e5d-9488-dfa53045ebfc","description":"Direita","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-55c9-723c-b8b5-20c1665c0a5f","description":"Frente (proa)","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-55c9-70b0-b002-fa3d8f0f0d26","description":"Traseira (popa)","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-55c9-7c1f-8b15-aa7cdf237df2","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a21348-94aa-7eae-ba09-829334cba03f","question":"Qual palavra \u00e9 usada no Alfabeto Fon\u00e9tico da OTAN para a letra D?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Delta \u00e9 a palavra-c\u00f3digo da OTAN para o D. As palavras padronizadas ajudam a tornar as letras claras em comunica\u00e7\u00f5es por r\u00e1dio e telefone.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-55c9-761c-a16e-7610e7a4efa1","description":"Delta","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-55c9-7b65-9ac4-ee147df0b7cd","description":"Dog","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-55c9-7ada-9331-b9a85294f22c","description":"Danube","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-55c9-756d-869